      "title": "身后追谥恭惠皇后",
      "summary": "新史天福十二年闰七月庚辰追尊四代祖考妣，列曾祖母杨氏谥为恭惠皇后；旧史逐代条亦记其追号。只记真实身后礼遇，不写生前即位或册立。",
      "year": 947,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "day",
      "sourceDate": "天福十二年闰七月庚辰",
      "phase": "posthumous",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v10",
          "paragraphId": "new-v10-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f571ea538c40cc4de66847022d8f784b9c9cbd3224e5ab0189c51ba43043f844",
          "excerpt": "庚辰，追尊祖考為皇帝，妣為皇后："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v10",
          "paragraphId": "new-v10-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f571ea538c40cc4de66847022d8f784b9c9cbd3224e5ab0189c51ba43043f844",
          "excerpt": "祖妣楊氏謚曰恭惠"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v099",
          "paragraphId": "old-v099-p1",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c0d85935b9d915427a90e314f51e3ae86d5fe40447ba039ceec9c5bb5668eda8",
          "excerpt": "曾祖母虢國太夫人楊氏，追謚恭惠皇后。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "皇后为身后追尊名号，不据此补此前宫廷生活。"
      ]
    }
  ]
